<Positioned left="48" top="272"><Text fontSize="24" color="#94A3B8" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" maxLines="1" overflow="CLIP">1.</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="96" top="272"><Text fontSize="24" color="#334155" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" maxLines="1" overflow="CLIP">本单为虚构排版测试，不是实际发票。</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="48" top="332"><Text fontSize="24" color="#94A3B8" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" maxLines="1" overflow="CLIP">2.</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="96" top="332"><Text fontSize="24" color="#334155" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" maxLines="1" overflow="CLIP">折扣在税前从货品小计扣除，运费不计税。</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="48" top="392"><Text fontSize="24" color="#94A3B8" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" maxLines="1" overflow="CLIP">3.</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="96" top="392"><Text fontSize="24" color="#334155" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" maxLines="1" overflow="CLIP">税额以税前折后货品金额乘6%，四舍五入至分；最终应付再加运费。</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="48" top="452"><Text fontSize="24" color="#94A3B8" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" maxLines="1" overflow="CLIP">4.</Text></Positioned>
<Positioned left="96" top="452"><Text fontSize="24" color="#334155" fontFamily="Inter,Noto Sans CJK SC" maxLines="1" overflow="CLIP">请核对订单编号、货品数量、单价与交付地址；任何修改应保留版本记录。</Text></Positioned>
